#: ../../source/reference/learn/generated/maxframe.learn.decomposition.PCA.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.learn.decomposition.PCA"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:1 of
msgid "Principal component analysis (PCA)"
msgstr "主成分分析 (PCA)"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:3 of
msgid ""
"Linear dimensionality reduction using Singular Value Decomposition of the"
" data to project it to a lower dimensional space. The input data is "
"centered but not scaled for each feature before applying the SVD."
msgstr ""
"使用数据的奇异值分解进行线性降维，将其投影到低维空间。在应用SVD之前，输入"
"数据被中心化但不对每个特征进行缩放。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:7 of
msgid ""
"It uses the LAPACK implementation of the full SVD or a randomized "
"truncated SVD by the method of Halko et al. 2009, depending on the shape "
"of the input data and the number of components to extract."
msgstr ""
"根据输入数据的形状和要提取的组件数量，它使用完整SVD的LAPACK实现或Halko等"
"人2009年方法的随机截断SVD。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:11 of
msgid ""
"It can also use the scipy.sparse.linalg ARPACK implementation of the "
"truncated SVD."
msgstr "它也可以使用scipy.sparse.linalg ARPACK的截断SVD实现。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:14 of
msgid ""
"Notice that this class does not support sparse input. See "
":class:`TruncatedSVD` for an alternative with sparse data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/learn/generated/maxframe.learn.decomposition.PCA.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:17 of
msgid ""
"Number of components to keep. if n_components is not set all components "
"are kept::      n_components == min(n_samples, n_features)  If "
"``n_components == 'mle'`` and ``svd_solver == 'full'``, Minka's MLE is "
"used to guess the dimension. Use of ``n_components == 'mle'`` will "
"interpret ``svd_solver == 'auto'`` as ``svd_solver == 'full'``.  If ``0 <"
" n_components < 1`` and ``svd_solver == 'full'``, select the number of "
"components such that the amount of variance that needs to be explained is"
" greater than the percentage specified by n_components.  If ``svd_solver "
"== 'arpack'``, the number of components must be strictly less than the "
"minimum of n_features and n_samples.  Hence, the None case results in::"
"      n_components == min(n_samples, n_features) - 1"
msgstr ""
"保留的组件数量。如果未设置n_components，则保留所有组件::      n_"
"components == min(n_samples, n_features)  如果 ``n_components == 'mle'`` "
"且 ``svd_solver == 'full'``，使用Minka的MLE来猜测维度。使用 ``n_"
"components == 'mle'`` 将把 ``svd_solver == 'auto'`` 解释为 ``svd_solver ="
"= 'full'``。  如果 ``0 < n_components < 1`` 且 ``svd_solver == 'full'``，"
"选择组件数量使得需要解释的方差量大于n_components指定的百分比。  如果 ``"
"svd_solver == 'arpack'``，组件数量必须严格小于n_features和n_samples的"
"最小值。  因此，None情况的结果是::      n_components == min(n_samples, n_"
"features) - 1"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:17 of
msgid ""
"Number of components to keep. if n_components is not set all components "
"are kept::"
msgstr "保留的组件数量。如果未设置n_components，则保留所有组件::"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:22 of
msgid ""
"If ``n_components == 'mle'`` and ``svd_solver == 'full'``, Minka's MLE is"
" used to guess the dimension. Use of ``n_components == 'mle'`` will "
"interpret ``svd_solver == 'auto'`` as ``svd_solver == 'full'``."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``n_components == 'mle'`` 且 ``svd_solver == 'full'``，使用Minka的"
"MLE来猜测维度。使用 ``n_components == 'mle'`` 将把 ``svd_solver == 'auto'"
"`` 解释为 ``svd_solver == 'full'``。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:26 of
msgid ""
"If ``0 < n_components < 1`` and ``svd_solver == 'full'``, select the "
"number of components such that the amount of variance that needs to be "
"explained is greater than the percentage specified by n_components."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``0 < n_components < 1`` 且 ``svd_solver == 'full'``，选择组件数量"
"使得需要解释的方差量大于n_components指定的百分比。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:30 of
msgid ""
"If ``svd_solver == 'arpack'``, the number of components must be strictly "
"less than the minimum of n_features and n_samples."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``svd_solver == 'arpack'``，组件数量必须严格小于n_features和n_"
"samples的最小值。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:33 of
msgid "Hence, the None case results in::"
msgstr "因此，None情况的结果是::"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:37 of
msgid ""
"If False, data passed to fit are overwritten and running "
"fit(X).transform(X) will not yield the expected results, use "
"fit_transform(X) instead."
msgstr ""
"如果为False，传递给fit的数据将被覆盖，运行fit(X).transform(X)不会产生预期"
"结果，请改用fit_transform(X)。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:41 of
msgid ""
"When True (False by default) the `components_` vectors are multiplied by "
"the square root of n_samples and then divided by the singular values to "
"ensure uncorrelated outputs with unit component-wise variances."
msgstr ""
"当为True时（默认为False），`components_`向量乘以n_samples的平方根然后除以"
"奇异值，以确保具有单位组件方差的不相关输出。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:45 of
msgid ""
"Whitening will remove some information from the transformed signal (the "
"relative variance scales of the components) but can sometime improve the "
"predictive accuracy of the downstream estimators by making their data "
"respect some hard-wired assumptions."
msgstr ""
"白化将从变换信号中移除一些信息（组件的相对方差尺度），但有时可以通过使"
"数据符合一些硬编码假设来提高下游估计器的预测准确性。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:50 of
#, python-format
msgid ""
"auto :     the solver is selected by a default policy based on `X.shape` "
"and     `n_components`: if the input data is larger than 500x500 and the"
"     number of components to extract is lower than 80% of the smallest"
"     dimension of the data, then the more efficient 'randomized'     "
"method is enabled. Otherwise the exact full SVD is computed and     "
"optionally truncated afterwards. full :     run exact full SVD calling "
"the standard LAPACK solver via     `scipy.linalg.svd` and select the "
"components by postprocessing arpack :     run SVD truncated to "
"n_components calling ARPACK solver via     `scipy.sparse.linalg.svds`. It"
" requires strictly     0 < n_components < min(X.shape) randomized :     "
"run randomized SVD by the method of Halko et al."
msgstr ""
"auto :     根据`X.shape`和`n_components`的默认策略选择求解器：如果输入"
"数据大于500x500且要提取的组件数量低于数据最小维度的80%，则启用更高效的'"
"randomized'方法。否则计算精确的完整SVD并可选地随后截断。 full :     通过`"
"scipy.linalg.svd`调用标准LAPACK求解器运行精确的完整SVD，并通过后处理选择"
"组件 arpack :     通过`scipy.sparse.linalg.svds`调用ARPACK求解器运行截断"
"到n_components的SVD。它要求严格 0 < n_components < min(X.shape) "
"randomized :     通过Halko等人的方法运行随机SVD"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:51 of
msgid "auto :"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:52 of
#, python-format
msgid ""
"the solver is selected by a default policy based on `X.shape` and "
"`n_components`: if the input data is larger than 500x500 and the number "
"of components to extract is lower than 80% of the smallest dimension of "
"the data, then the more efficient 'randomized' method is enabled. "
"Otherwise the exact full SVD is computed and optionally truncated "
"afterwards."
msgstr ""
"根据`X.shape`和`n_components`的默认策略选择求解器：如果输入数据大于"
"500x500且要提取的组件数量低于数据最小维度的80%，则启用更高效的'randomized"
"'方法。否则计算精确的完整SVD并可选地随后截断。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:58 of
msgid "full :"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:59 of
msgid ""
"run exact full SVD calling the standard LAPACK solver via "
"`scipy.linalg.svd` and select the components by postprocessing"
msgstr ""
"通过`scipy.linalg.svd`调用标准LAPACK求解器运行精确的完整SVD，并通过后处理"
"选择组件"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:61 of
msgid "arpack :"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:62 of
msgid ""
"run SVD truncated to n_components calling ARPACK solver via "
"`scipy.sparse.linalg.svds`. It requires strictly 0 < n_components < "
"min(X.shape)"
msgstr ""
"通过`scipy.sparse.linalg.svds`调用ARPACK求解器运行截断到n_components的SVD"
"。它要求严格 0 < n_components < min(X.shape)"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:65 of
msgid "randomized :"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:66 of
msgid "run randomized SVD by the method of Halko et al."
msgstr "通过Halko等人的方法运行随机SVD"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:68 of
msgid "Tolerance for singular values computed by svd_solver == 'arpack'."
msgstr "svd_solver == 'arpack'计算的奇异值容差。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:70 of
msgid ""
"Number of iterations for the power method computed by svd_solver == "
"'randomized'."
msgstr "svd_solver == 'randomized'计算的幂方法迭代次数。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:73 of
msgid ""
"If int, random_state is the seed used by the random number generator; If "
"RandomState instance, random_state is the random number generator; If "
"None, the random number generator is the RandomState instance used by "
"`np.random`. Used when ``svd_solver`` == 'arpack' or 'randomized'."
msgstr ""
"如果是int，random_state是随机数生成器使用的种子；如果是RandomState实例，"
"random_state是随机数生成器；如果是None，随机数生成器是`np.random`使用的"
"RandomState实例。在``svd_solver`` == 'arpack'或'randomized'时使用。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:81 of
msgid ""
"Principal axes in feature space, representing the directions of maximum "
"variance in the data. The components are sorted by "
"``explained_variance_``."
msgstr ""
"特征空间中的主轴，表示数据中方差最大的方向。组件按``explained_variance_``"
"排序。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA of
msgid "type"
msgstr "类型"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:85 of
msgid "tensor, shape (n_components, n_features)"
msgstr "tensor, 形状 (n_components, n_features)"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:89 of
msgid "The amount of variance explained by each of the selected components."
msgstr "每个选定组件解释的方差量。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:91 of
msgid "Equal to n_components largest eigenvalues of the covariance matrix of X."
msgstr "等于 X 协方差矩阵的 n_components 个最大特征值。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:94
#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:103
#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:111 of
msgid "tensor, shape (n_components,)"
msgstr "tensor, 形状为 (n_components,)"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:98 of
msgid "Percentage of variance explained by each of the selected components."
msgstr "每个选定分量解释的方差百分比。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:100 of
msgid ""
"If ``n_components`` is not set then all components are stored and the sum"
" of the ratios is equal to 1.0."
msgstr "如果未设置 ``n_components``，则存储所有分量，且比率之和等于 1.0。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:107 of
msgid ""
"The singular values corresponding to each of the selected components. The"
" singular values are equal to the 2-norms of the ``n_components`` "
"variables in the lower-dimensional space."
msgstr ""
"对应于每个选定分量的奇异值。奇异值等于低维空间中 ``n_components`` 变量的 "
"2-范数。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:115 of
msgid "Per-feature empirical mean, estimated from the training set."
msgstr "从训练集估计的每特征经验均值。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:117 of
msgid "Equal to `X.mean(axis=0)`."
msgstr "等于 `X.mean(axis=0)`。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:119 of
msgid "tensor, shape (n_features,)"
msgstr "tensor, 形状为 (n_features,)"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:123 of
msgid ""
"The estimated number of components. When n_components is set to 'mle' or "
"a number between 0 and 1 (with svd_solver == 'full') this number is "
"estimated from input data. Otherwise it equals the parameter "
"n_components, or the lesser value of n_features and n_samples if "
"n_components is None."
msgstr ""
"估计的分量数量。当 n_components 设置为 'mle' 或 0 到 1 之间的数字时（svd_"
"solver == 'full'），此数字从输入数据估计。否则它等于参数 n_components，"
"或者当 n_components 为 None 时取 n_features 和 n_samples 中的较小值。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:129 of
msgid "int"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:133 of
msgid ""
"The estimated noise covariance following the Probabilistic PCA model from"
" Tipping and Bishop 1999. See \"Pattern Recognition and Machine "
"Learning\" by C. Bishop, 12.2.1 p. 574 or "
"http://www.miketipping.com/papers/met-mppca.pdf. It is required to "
"compute the estimated data covariance and score samples."
msgstr ""
"根据 Tipping 和 Bishop 1999 年的概率 PCA 模型估计的噪声协方差。参见 C. "
"Bishop 的《模式识别与机器学习》，第 12.2.1 节第 574 页或 http://www."
"miketipping.com/papers/met-mppca.pdf。需要计算估计的数据协方差和评分样本"
"。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:139 of
msgid ""
"Equal to the average of (min(n_features, n_samples) - n_components) "
"smallest eigenvalues of the covariance matrix of X."
msgstr ""
"等于 X 协方差矩阵的 (min(n_features, n_samples) - n_components) 个最小"
"特征值的平均值。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:142 of
msgid "float"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:146 of
msgid ""
"For n_components == 'mle', this class uses the method of *Minka, T. P. "
"\"Automatic choice of dimensionality for PCA\". In NIPS, pp. 598-604*"
msgstr ""
"对于 n_components == 'mle'，此类使用 *Minka, T. P. \"PCA 维度的自动选择\""
"。在 NIPS，第 598-604 页* 的方法"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:145 of
msgid "引用"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:149 of
msgid ""
"Implements the probabilistic PCA model from: Tipping, M. E., and Bishop, "
"C. M. (1999). \"Probabilistic principal component analysis\". Journal of "
"the Royal Statistical Society: Series B (Statistical Methodology), 61(3),"
" 611-622. via the score and score_samples methods. See "
"http://www.miketipping.com/papers/met-mppca.pdf"
msgstr ""
"实现来自：Tipping, M. E. 和 Bishop, C. M. (1999). \"概率主成分分析\"。"
"皇家统计学会期刊：B 系列（统计方法论），61(3)，611-622 的概率 PCA 模型，"
"通过 score 和 score_samples 方法。参见 http://www.miketipping.com/papers/"
"met-mppca.pdf"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:156 of
msgid "For svd_solver == 'arpack', refer to `scipy.sparse.linalg.svds`."
msgstr "对于 svd_solver == 'arpack'，请参阅 `scipy.sparse.linalg.svds`。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._pca.PCA:158 of
msgid ""
"For svd_solver == 'randomized', see: *Halko, N., Martinsson, P. G., and "
"Tropp, J. A. (2011). \"Finding structure with randomness: Probabilistic "
"algorithms for constructing approximate matrix decompositions\". SIAM "
"review, 53(2), 217-288.* and also *Martinsson, P. G., Rokhlin, V., and "
"Tygert, M. (2011). \"A randomized algorithm for the decomposition of "
"matrices\". Applied and Computational Harmonic Analysis, 30(1), 47-68.*"
msgstr ""
"对于 svd_solver == 'randomized'，参见：*Halko, N., Martinsson, P. G., 和 "
"Tropp, J. A. (2011). \"通过随机性寻找结构：构造近似矩阵分解的概率算法\"。"
"SIAM 评论，53(2)，217-288。* 以及 *Martinsson, P. G., Rokhlin, V., 和 "
"Tygert, M. (2011). \"矩阵分解的随机算法\"。应用和计算谐波分析，30(1)，47-"
"68。*"

